     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">#maptimeDavis and the Davis R Users Group are pleased to announce our “R for Spatial” workshop April 28, 2020 from 10:00am-12:00pm with speaker Leah Nagel via Zoom!  This workshop will focus on the newly updated SF package.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Attendees are welcome to watch or follow along on their own R Studio console.  If you plan to follow along, please review the Getting Started section of Leah’s ReadMe on her GitHub repository for this workshop to install the necessary software\r\n and R packages: <a href=\"https://github.com/ldnagel/spatial-r-for-gis-users\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ldnagel/spatial-r-for-gis-users&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0sVCCQLB_Qgt0eq5O6dBOK\">https://github.com/ldnagel/spatial-r-for-gis-users</a>\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We will assume attendees have an introductory understanding of non-spatial R programming to allow time to focus on spatial functions and a basic understanding of GIS concepts outside of R (desktop GIS experience, for example).  Leah has\r\n a script to help get you started or refresh your memory if it’s been a while since you’ve worked in R:\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/ldnagel/spatial-r-for-gis-users/blob/master/scripts/r-basics-code.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ldnagel/spatial-r-for-gis-users/blob/master/scripts/r-basics-code.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0i1eQN5VpQvYCRoElKFL4T\">\r\nhttps://github.com/ldnagel/spatial-r-for-gis-users/blob/master/scripts/r-basics-code.R</a>  Please contact Michele Tobias\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a> if you’d like help finding other introductory materials.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Zoom Link:  <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ONLr0m0TX8yj9qzahRBmH\">\r\nhttps://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/</a> (link at the bottom of the page)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://github.com/maptimedavis/MaptimeDavis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/maptimedavis/MaptimeDavis&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DlMiSKPBLHQWzCZd4GARv\">#maptimeDavis</a>, the\r\n<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ONLr0m0TX8yj9qzahRBmH\">Spatial Sciences Research Cluster</a>, and the\r\n<a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PvwHGe5P4gGFfo83YyyHR\">Davis R Users Group</a> are supported by the <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430558000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1jjnM94E3iZM4OMGnYyL_t\">\r\nUC Davis DataLab</a> and by the contributions and participation of our community.  Please send questions to Michele Tobias\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Upcoming Workshops &amp; Meetings (Tuesdays 10:00-12:00 via Zoom):<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">28-Apr   #maptimeDavis: <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-workshop-maptimedavis/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-workshop-maptimedavis/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430559000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08VVn7Vl9Djh5J3KzP_meE\">\r\nR for Spatial</a> with speaker Leah Nagel<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">5-May   Spatial Sciences Research Cluster: <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-research-cluster-spatial-sciences-3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-research-cluster-spatial-sciences-3/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430559000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fSycDkEZXh7M5uUWrjbbc\">\r\nMore Spatial SQL</a>         <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">12-May #maptimeDavis: <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-workshop-maptimedavis-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-workshop-maptimedavis-2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430559000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Q7-iV5TufqnkiekSHayKM\">\r\nMapbox</a> with speaker Megan Danielson from Mapbox<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">19-May Spatial Sciences Research Cluster: <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-research-cluster-spatial-sciences-4/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-research-cluster-spatial-sciences-4/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430559000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2lW-4DnR8D0yMSrjufZSkE\">\r\nTopic To Be Decided</a>    <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">26-May                <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">2-Jun     Spatial Sciences Research Cluster: <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-research-cluster-spatial-sciences-5/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/virtual-research-cluster-spatial-sciences-5/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430559000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Vennz2zM-U4SJ1vzJl_-C\">\r\nTopic To Be Decided</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430559000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cPhcVxMHhkp6e8GlT5Ifi\">Davis R Users Group</a> holds weekly work sessions online on Thursdays from 10:00AM–12:00PM.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Geospatial Data Specialist<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">DataLab: Data Science &amp; Informatics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Data &amp; Digital Scholarship<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">370 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">ORCID: </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,serif;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465430559000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10MyYIVFEuRkcbPYGtMDDj\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">0000-0002-2954-8710</span></a>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
